      "problem": "Find the minor of  ${e}_{15}$ in  $E=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & -3 & 8 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 11 & 5 & 4 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -6 & 0 & 7\\end{aligned}].$",
